      "content": "Here's a draft email that aims to strike a balance between conveying the urgency and importance of the project while maintaining a professional tone:\n\nSubject: Support Coral Reef Restoration Efforts\n\nDear valued supporters,\n\nWe're writing to inform you that a severe heatwave has caused widespread coral bleaching on our North Reef, with 70% of the coral suffering from the trauma. This devastating loss of biodiversity is just the latest challenge to our ecosystems, and we must act swiftly to mitigate the damage. We're launching an emergency restoration project to deploy nurseries and replant areas most at risk. Your support is crucial in helping us meet this pressing deadline - we need $50,000 by [insert date] to ensure these efforts are successful. Every contribution will help us save these critical colonies and preserve the delicate balance of our reefs.\n\n[Your sentiment classifier score here, pending review]",
