      "content": "Here's a revised version with a bit more emotional resonance:\n\nSubject: Together, We Can Rebuild Our Reefs\n\nDear supporters,\n\nIn the face of disaster, we've seen the resilience of our reefs time and again. But the recent heatwave has left us with a monumental challenge: 70% of our North Reef coral has bleached, a devastating blow that threatens the very foundation of our ecosystem. Yet, even in this darkest hour, we remain hopeful. We believe that with the right support, we can deploy vital nurseries and replant areas most at risk, giving our coral reefs a fighting chance to recover. We need your help to make it happen – $50,000 is needed within the next three weeks to save these critical colonies. Together, we can turn this crisis into an opportunity, and you can be a part of it.\n\n[Your sentiment classifier score here, pending review]\n\nI've tried to inject a sense of hope and urgency, while still being grounded in the facts.",
